 / 64 products</span><span class="os-chip good"><?= number_format($metrics['prices']??0) ?> / 64 price versions</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['categories']??0) ?> categories</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['tiers']??0) ?> exact tiers</span><span class="os-chip"><?= number_format($metrics['images']??0) ?> online image refs</span></div></section><?php if($error):?><div class="pp-alert bad"><strong>Audit diagnostic:</strong> <?= product_h($error) ?></div><?php endif;?><section class="os-card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="os-title-row"><div><h2>Completion Checks</h2><p>Online image references are not treated as verified until manually reviewed; every unmatched product has a local placeholder.</p></div><span class="pp-badge <?= $complete?'':'bad' ?>"><?= $passed ?> PASS / <?= $failed ?> REVIEW</span></div><div class="pp-audit-grid"><?php foreach($checks as $c):?><div class="pp-audit"><div><b><?= product_h($c['name']) ?></b><span><?= product_h($c['detail']) ?></span></div><strong class="<?= $c['ok']?'':'bad' ?>"><?= $c['ok']?'PASS':'REVIEW' ?></strong></div><?php endforeach;?></div></section><section class="pp-grid"><article class="os-card pp-span-6"><h2>PDF Source Integrity</h2><div class="pp-source"><b>Associate PDF</b><span><?= product_h($data['associate_pdf_sha256']??'—') ?></span></div><div class="pp-source"><b>Preferred Customer PDF</b><span><?= product_h($data['preferred_pdf_sha256']??'—') ?></span></div></article><aside class="os-card pp-span-6"><h2>Image Coverage</h2><p><strong><?= number_format($metrics['images']??0) ?></strong> products currently have online packaging references. <strong><?= number_format(max(0,64-($metrics['images']??0))) ?></strong> use the safe local placeholder until an exact image is verified.</p><p style="margin-top:9px">Verified online images: <?= number_format($metrics['verified_images']??0) ?>. Image Manager is intentionally conservative.</p><div class="pp-actions"><a href="product_images.php">Review Images →</a><a href="product_import_center.php">Future PDF Import →</a><a href="product_quotes.php">Saved Quotes →</a></div></aside></section><div class="os-footer-note"><strong>Completion rule:</strong> STEP 11 pricing passes only when the reviewed PDFs reconcile to 64 products/listings/current price versions and 532 source-exact tier prices. Images may remain in review/placeholder state without affecting pricing integrity.</div></main></div><script src="assets/business-collapsible.js?v=20260820-1" defer></script></body></html>
